    "created_at": "2025-02-26T17:44:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-26T17:44:46Z",
    "body": "@devanlai Thanks a load this helped out! I looked through the output buffer and when I saw something that included `POWERON_RESET` I called `port.setSignals`.\n\n```\nif (port && line.includes('POWERON_RESET')) {\n    port.setSignals({dataTerminalReady: false, requestToSend: false});\n}\n```\n\nNow, it works as expected. Thanks again.",
